    {
      "id": "claim_95b470572522421cbe84fc001775fa8f",
      "statement": "PSP Connector E-Wallet is a production Vert.x-based Java service in the payment-platform system that owns an e-wallet connector API and currently composes one Vert.x verticle, one HTTP server, an Oracle Hikari pool, and an outbound e-wallet client configuration at startup.",
