      "id": "claim_18d87a020b1149f9ab4cfb07fcc05644",
      "statement": "The runtime lifecycle is: Main loads app.properties, eagerly creates the Hikari Oracle datasource, configures InstrumentPostHandler, and launches PspServer in a background thread; PspServer creates Vertx from property-derived options and deploys PspVertical; PspVertical then creates shared HTTP clients and the HTTP server.",
