      "id": "claim_01e17d12bb674d82ba2b61480b952b75",
      "statement": "InstrumentPostHandler validates that user_id, mobile, and email are non-empty, transforms the request into an e-wallet payload with ewallet.service.group as group_id, signs and posts it to the configured e-wallet service, and treats only upstream HTTP 201 as success.",
